                    <!-- About -->
                    <div class="headline"><h2>About ASHA</h2></div>
                    <p>The American Speech-Language-Hearing Association (ASHA) is the national professional, scientific, and credentialing association for 247,000 members, certificate holders, and affiliates who are audiologists; speech-language pathologists; speech, language, and hearing scientists; audiology and speech-language pathology assistants; and students.</p>
<p><